Raw transactions listing matches Ledger.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager print

========== FILE ==========

commodity USD
  default
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity FUND
  format 1000.000 FUND
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
tag Used
tag Unused
account Assets Fund
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Unused
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 9 USD
P 2024-01-01 FUND 10 USD

2024-01-02 Buy
  ; Used: yes
  Assets:Fund  2 FUND {{20 USD}}
  Assets Fund  -20 USD

2024-01-03 No change
  Assets:Fund  0 FUND
  Equity:Opening  0 FUND

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-02 Buy
    ; Used: yes
    Assets:Fund                         2.000 FUND {10.00 USD}
    Assets Fund                           -20.00 USD
